app KeywordsMap
description "Documentation page detailing Butter's attention-weighted vocabulary, logic mapping, and efficiency metrics."
version "1.0.0"

feature Overview
  description "Hero section introducing Butter's keyword system and page purpose."
  version "1.0.0"

  actions
    "Render page title and subtitle describing attention-weighted vocabulary, signal-to-noise efficiency, and logic gate mapping"
    "Write introductory paragraph explaining how keyword weights influence LLM interpretation and execution"

feature AttentionScaling
  description "A technical analysis of how Butter keywords influence LLM attention weights and reasoning."
  version "1.0.0"

  params
    scale_range string

  actions
    "Introduce the Mechanics of AI Intent — explain how LLMs allocate disproportionate attention to structural keywords"
    "Render Attention Weight Table with Butter keywords"
    "Summarize semantic scaling impact — describe the execution, constraint, declaration, metadata hierarchy and its effect on LLM reasoning budget allocation"

feature SignalToNoiseEfficiency
  description "Comparison of semantic signal density between Butter DSL, JSON, and Natural Language."
  version "1.0.0"

  actions
    "Define Semantic Density — explain how Butter DSL maximises signal per token by eliminating decorative tokens"
    "Render Signal-to-Noise stacked bar graph comparing Butter DSL, JSON, and Natural Language"
    "Provide efficiency comparison table covering signal density, structural overhead, tokens per action, ambiguity sources, condition clarity, execution order, and LLM context usage"
    "Add key insight blockquote summarizing why Butter achieves 92% signal density"

feature LogicGateMap
  description "A decision-tree visualization of how Butter keywords prune AI hallucination."
  version "1.0.0"

  actions
    "Define the Deterministic Logic Gate concept — explain how keywords function as gates in an LLM reasoning pipeline"
    "Render Keyword Influence Map SVG decision tree"
    "Explain pruning impact — describe how each conditional keyword (if, unless, when, while, enforce) eliminates hallucination branches"
